 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center Header_buttonContainer__rN6i5\"><button class=\"pointer-events-auto Header_button__qn2Wj Button_main__NewW7 Button_default__CcbQU\"><span class=\"Button_inner__d7ZPg\">Menu</span></button></div><div class=\"hidden w-[130px] justify-end md:flex\"><a class=\"pointer-events-auto\" aria-label=\"About\" href=\"/about\"></a></div></div></div><main style=\"--theme-primary:16 16 16;--theme-secondary:255 255 255;--theme-tertiary:255 255 255\" class=\"bg-black\"><div style=\"opacity:1\"><div class=\"relative z-main bg-theme-primary transition-bg duration-theme\"><sectio",
   "text": "MenuThe ExaminationA bold newsroom tackling corporations vs human healthVisit SiteThe Examination is an online newsroom whose mission is to hold the powerful to account. They expose corporate malfeasance that profits from harming human health. Industries refer to hidden costs on society as “externalities”… while those affected by them use stronger names - like infertility, lung cancer, or dead rivers."
  },
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></span></span></a></div></h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Category</h3><h4>Brand + Website</h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Date</h3><h4>2023 - ∞</h4></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-theme=\"light\" class=\"text-theme-secondary transition-colors duration-theme\"><div class=\"WrokBloks_main__IqYqU\"><div class=\"ui-grid mx-auto my-xl-20 max-w-site gap-y-6 md:my-xl-40\"><div class=\"col-span-full lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-12\"><h3 class=\"t-p-md font-medi",
   "text": "CategoryBrand + WebsiteDate2023 - ∞Introducing The ExaminationThe Examination’s team of journalists probe unethical practices across big tobacco, industrial food, and polluting industries."
  },
  {
   "html": "This is storytelling to save lives, accountability journalism. With all the depth of investigative journalism but unafraid to have a point-of-view - they actively explore solutions and celebrate change.",
   "text": "This is storytelling to save lives, accountability journalism. With all the depth of investigative journalism but unafraid to have a point-of-view - they actively explore solutions and celebrate change."
  },
  {
   "html": "They needed a brand and digital platform to bring these stories to life and showcase their mission, capturing the imagination of readers, donors and activists globally.",
   "text": "They needed a brand and digital platform to bring these stories to life and showcase their mission, capturing the imagination of readers, donors and activists globally."
  },
  {
   "html": "We distilled their core values and explored creative territories and visual metaphors to express them. We found the answer in their name.",
   "text": "We distilled their core values and explored creative territories and visual metaphors to express them. We found the answer in their name."
  },
  {
   "html": "The Examination is an <i>ongoing</i> investigation of the inner workings of business, government and white collar crime. Where every article and topic forms part of a resolute whole.",
   "text": "The Examination is an ongoing investigation of the inner workings of business, government and white collar crime. Where every article and topic forms part of a resolute whole."
  },
  {
   "html": "We crafted an identity system that feels as if a dossier of critical information has been placed in your hands. Organized. Essential. Prepared for you.",
   "text": "We crafted an identity system that feels as if a dossier of critical information has been placed in your hands. Organized. Essential. Prepared for you."
  },
  {
   "html": "There&#x27;s a sense of uncovering and revealing, of sliding open to reveal information in hidden documents. The bright colours of highlighted words bring a sense of urgency, drawing attention to key information.",
   "text": "There&#x27;s a sense of uncovering and revealing, of sliding open to reveal information in hidden documents. The bright colours of highlighted words bring a sense of urgency, drawing attention to key information."
  },
  {
   "html": "Gladeye has designed a series of award-winning long-form articles for publications including <a href=\"https://investigation.rollingstone.com/dj-photo-war-crimes-bosnia/\" target=\"_blank\">Rolling Stone</a>, <a href=\"https://highline.huffingtonpost.com/articles/en/poor-millennials/\" target=\"_blank\">HuffPost</a> and <a href=\"https://www.themarshallproject.org/2019/09/24/detained\" target=\"_blank\">The Marshall Project</a>. We’d developed a deep understanding of editorial storytelling but had yet to develop a journalism platform from the ground up.",
   "text": "Gladeye has designed a series of award-winning long-form articles for publications including Rolling Stone, HuffPost and The Marshall Project. We’d developed a deep understanding of editorial storytelling but had yet to develop a journalism platform from the ground up."
  },
  {
   "html": "We were excited to be able to realise this vision.",
   "text": "We were excited to be able to realise this vision."
  },
  {
   "html": "Over time The Examination will grow to encompass many topics but beginning with the urgent health issues of Tobacco, Pollution, and Industrialised Food.",
   "text": "Over time The Examination will grow to encompass many topics but beginning with the urgent health issues of Tobacco, Pollution, and Industrialised Food."
  },
  {
   "html": "We faced the challenge of translating this broad array of topics into a visually cohesive, engaging website.",
   "text": "We faced the challenge of translating this broad array of topics into a visually cohesive, engaging website."
  },
  {
   "html": "The Examination exists to tell stories not told elsewhere.",
   "text": "The Examination exists to tell stories not told elsewhere."
  },
  {
   "html": "As a new brand they saw the value of uniqueness - of standing out from the templated grid layout and category nav that is everywhere in digital journalism.",
   "text": "As a new brand they saw the value of uniqueness - of standing out from the templated grid layout and category nav that is everywhere in digital journalism."
  },
  {
   "html": "We looked to combine the monochromatic authority of The NY Times or The Guardian - with a sense of punk energy; disruptors of the status quo.",
   "text": "We looked to combine the monochromatic authority of The NY Times or The Guardian - with a sense of punk energy; disruptors of the status quo."
  },
  {
   "html": "We want The Examination to be graphic - big type, big  images, bold colour palette and illustration, but with a brilliant reading experience at the heart of it.",
   "text": "We want The Examination to be graphic - big type, big  images, bold colour palette and illustration, but with a brilliant reading experience at the heart of it."
  },
  {
   "html": "There is a sense of uncovering secrets in the site&#x27;s  animations and interactions. Topics are presented as sliding drawers, creating moments of discovery for the reader as they unlock new knowledge.",
   "text": "There is a sense of uncovering secrets in the site&#x27;s  animations and interactions. Topics are presented as sliding drawers, creating moments of discovery for the reader as they unlock new knowledge."
  },
  {
   "html": "Each topic has its own theme colour, flowing throughout the UI design and allowing readers to easily find what they connect with on return visits.",
   "text": "Each topic has its own theme colour, flowing throughout the UI design and allowing readers to easily find what they connect with on return visits."
  },
  {
   "html": "To complement this brand language our Illustrator, <a href=\"https://sugacyan.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Pablo Espinosa</a> delivered striking visuals for each topic. Simple and graphic, they provide a sense of grit to balance the sleek designs.",
   "text": "To complement this brand language our Illustrator, Pablo Espinosa delivered striking visuals for each topic. Simple and graphic, they provide a sense of grit to balance the sleek designs."
  },
  {
   "html": "The Examination articles will often expand into series or follow-ups. We’ve laid the foundation in the first release for a powerful feature called “Objects of Interest&#x27;&#x27;. Initially these are footnotes allowing you to follow characters across different stories.",
   "text": "The Examination articles will often expand into series or follow-ups. We’ve laid the foundation in the first release for a powerful feature called “Objects of Interest&#x27;&#x27;. Initially these are footnotes allowing you to follow characters across different stories."
  },
  {
   "html": "They’ll grow into their own “dossiers”, where you can explore every article, quote and reference tied to corporations, individuals and their actions over time.",
   "text": "They’ll grow into their own “dossiers”, where you can explore every article, quote and reference tied to corporations, individuals and their actions over time."
  },
  {
   "html": "<a href=\"https://www.storyblok.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Storyblok</a> has the ability for live previews of a headless website - a powerful feature which makes editing content far more tactile. We work closely with clients to align our CMS configuration with their workflow, and The Examination was no exception.",
   "text": "Storyblok has the ability for live previews of a headless website - a powerful feature which makes editing content far more tactile. We work closely with clients to align our CMS configuration with their workflow, and The Examination was no exception."
  },
  {
   "html": "It’s an interactive space where serious journalism meets beautifully flexible digital design. The editorial team are also able to integrate themed <a href=\"https://www.datawrapper.de/\" target=\"_blank\">Datawrapper</a> infographics, charts and other elements directly into the flow of articles.",
   "text": "It’s an interactive space where serious journalism meets beautifully flexible digital design. The editorial team are also able to integrate themed Datawrapper infographics, charts and other elements directly into the flow of articles."
  },
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"Awards_item__YgOl7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/the-examination/44307/\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-start gap-x-2 py-3 sm:gap-x-4 sm:py-4\"><h4 class=\"t-work-award flex-shrink-0 font-medium\">CSS Design Awards</h4><h5 class=\"t-work-award-alt truncate\">Special Kudos, Innovation, UX Design, UI Design</h5><div class=\"h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0 sm:h-lg-4 sm:w-lg-4\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 17.57 17.57\" class=\"fill-current\"><path d=\"M1.03 17.57c-.26 0-.53-.1-.73-.3-.4-.4-.4-1.06 0-1.46L14.04 2.07H1.03C.46 2.0",
